than 3 hr a nuclear envelope fraction in 55&#x02013;60% yield as assessed by phospholipid recovery. Its gross chemical composition was determined and its morphology was studied electron microscopically by sectioning, freeze etching, and negative staining procedures. </p></abstract></article-meta></front></article>